+# styled-components.js
+
+> `Xxx.extend` not recognized as tag
+
+## Option 1
+
+`````json
+{"printWidth":80}
+`````
+
+### Diff
+
+`````diff
+===================================================================
+--- prettier
++++ oxfmt
+@@ -12,15 +12,17 @@
